# Interface contract / OpenCode

**Before any action**, load the global Contract `~/.agents/AGENTS.md`.

---

_This file is loaded natively by OpenCode at startup (`~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`, no custom hook needed). It stacks with any `AGENTS.md` found by walking up the directory tree from the current project (no replacement, both are loaded)._

_For any improvement to this contract, update the reference source in `~/.agents/AGENTS.md`. Do not add anything here except what is strictly specific to OpenCode._
